## Final Reminder

These prompts are a routing library, not a rule that every named plugin must always be called

The strongest ChatGPT workflow is usually:

```text
right source of truth
+ right specialist plugin
+ right verification plugin
+ explicit completion gate
```

Add the task-specific context under the closest block, remove plugins that do not apply, and keep the exact installed `@Plugin Name` syntax so ChatGPT can route correctly
